gametitle=Gran Turismo 3 - A-Spec USA v1.10 [PBPX-95503] [8AA991B0]
comment=Editable chase camera v1 - selectable values

// ONLY for USA v1.10, PBPX-95503, CRC 8AA991B0.
// These controls do not change field of view (FOV).
//
// HOW TO CHOOSE VALUES
// Keep exactly ONE patch line active in EACH of the five sections below.
// Put // at the start of the current active line, then remove // from the
// line you want instead. The normal numbers on the right describe each choice.
// Leave every line in the FIXED CODE section active and unchanged.
//
// Starting preset: height 2.5, pitch DOWN 12.5 degrees, distance 6,
// horizontal spring 60, horizontal damping 16.
// Motion pairs to try: stock 30/10, current preset 60/16, firmer 120/22.
//
// To use this file, copy it to your PCSX2 cheats folder as 8AA991B0.pnach in place of
// the existing camera cheat, then restart GT3. Enable only one camera cheat.
// Select chase view with R1 under GT3's default controls.
// Height and distance are encoded as negative offsets; use the labels,
// not the hexadecimal values, when choosing how high or far back to sit.

// -------------------- HEIGHT --------------------
// Game units above the car origin; higher raises the camera. Steps: 0.25.
